# Yarn 4
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/sdks
!.yarn/versions
.pnp.*

# ===== 秘密与本地环境（真实值不进仓库，见 AGENTS.md）=====
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
/development/

# ===== 构建产物 =====
/out
/build
/target/
dist/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ===== Tauri 生成（tauri-build 每次构建再生的自动补全 schema）=====
/src-tauri/gen/schemas/

# ===== 旧 GUI（Electron 架构，P7 前保留）=====
/src/lib

# ===== 运行时日志与崩溃转储 =====
*.log
hs_err_pid*

# ===== 浏览器/桌面 E2E 产物（Playwright/WDIO，P4+ 启用）=====
test-results/
playwright-report/

# ===== 编辑器与操作系统 =====
